sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Tomasz (chat)
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Overseer
  participant M as Meeseeks
  participant W as Worker+Podman
  participant C as Check container (read-only)
  T->>G: task: goal + check type + check
  G->>G: refuse if no check
  G->>O: create task
  O->>M: spawn (reuse solved work first)
  loop until check passes
    M->>O: ask permit
    O-->>M: permit (or none if killed/paused)
    M->>W: run step (Kyo: brain, Podman)
    W-->>M: step result + heartbeat
    M->>C: server runs check
    C-->>M: pass / fail
  end
  M->>O: heartbeats (each step)
  M->>O: result (event in journal)
  O->>G: done
  G->>T: one result message
